
# Secrets. Broad by design: the failure mode is always a variant nobody thought
# to list (.env.bak-2026-09-13, .env.prod). Examples stay committable so the
# next person knows what to set.
.env*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
*.pem
*.p12
credentials.json
service-account*.json
.npmrc
.netrc
